    "updated_at": "2025-01-27T18:26:54Z",
    "body": "Note the [\"Note\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#attr-dialog-closedby:~:text=The%20Auto%20state%20behaves%20as%20Close%20Request%20state%20when%20the%20dialog%20was%20shown%20using%20its%20showModal()%20method%3B%20otherwise%20the%20None%20state.), which attempted to define the behavior:\n\n> Note: The [Auto](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#attr-dialog-closedby-auto-state) state behaves as [Close Request](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#attr-dialog-closedby-closerequest-state) state when the [dialog](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#the-dialog-element) was shown using its [showModal()](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#dom-dialog-showmodal) method; otherwise the [None](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#attr-dialog-closedby-none-state) state.\n\nI think (2) basically means converting that from a Note to an actual algorithm, right? If so, and if there's a pointer somewhere for how to word that, I'm happy to give it a try!\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
