    "body": "> My preference would be (1) personally. It feels odd that round tripping the IDL property with its own value can change the behaviour of the element?\n\nThis is already the case for some other reflection-ish properties, like `spellcheck`, `writingSUggestions`, `autocapitalize`, etc. But maybe this case is a bit more dangerous?",
