    "created_at": "2025-01-29T23:59:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-29T23:59:46Z",
    "body": "So there are two scenarios that conflict here:\n1. You want to be able to do `dialog.closedBy = dialog.closedBy` (this is better with option (1))\n2. You want the IDL reflection to tell you what's actually happening (this is better with option (2))\n\nI guess I don't know what the use case is for <span>#</span>1. I can see the point of <span>#</span>2 - it allows code to \"ask\" what behavior they're getting.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
